{
  "id": "r3-content-addressing",
  "title": "Content Addressing & User Consent",
  "description": "The R3 document's display section drives informed user consent — the resource describes what IT does, including irreversible actions. The agent's Person Server (PS) fetches the R3 document and presents it to the user before approving. The r3_s256 hash baked into the final auth token creates a permanent, content-addressed audit record: even if the resource later updates the document at the same URI, the approved semantics are pinned forever.",
  "spec_section": "R3 §5 — R3 Document, §6 — Auth Token Extensions",
  "category": "r3",
  "participants": [
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "label": "Agent",
      "type": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "resource",
      "label": "Calendar Resource",
      "type": "resource"
    },
    {
      "id": "ps",
      "label": "Person Server",
      "type": "person-server"
    },
    {
      "id": "user",
      "label": "User",
      "type": "user"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "resource",
      "label": "POST /authorize + r3_operations → resource token (r3_uri + r3_s256)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://calendar.example.com/authorize",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "calendar.example.com",
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Content-Digest": "sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:U2lnbmF0dXJlQnl0ZXNFeGFtcGxlVmFsdWVGb3JEZW1vbnN0cmF0aW9uUHVycG9zZXNPbmx5:"
      },
      "request_body": {
        "r3_operations": {
          "vocabulary": "urn:aauth:vocabulary:mcp",
          "operations": [
            {
              "tool": "create_calendar_event"
            },
            {
              "tool": "send_calendar_invite"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "resource_token": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InJlc291cmNlLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoicmVzb3VyY2Urand0In0..placeholder"
      },
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "Person Token",
          "typ": "aa-person+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9..cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ",
          "header": {
            "alg": "EdDSA",
            "kid": "ps-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-person+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://ps.example",
            "dwk": "aauth-person.json",
            "aud": "https://calendar.example.com",
            "sub": "e4da3b7fbbce2345d7772b0674a318d5",
            "cnf": {
              "jwk": {
                "kty": "OKP",
                "crv": "Ed25519",
                "x": "T_1-DXNIxIv0tFEqrD9q4LHu4VcHJgsiDPN__R1_Y2U",
                "kid": "agent-key-1"
              }
            },
            "jti": "pt-8b41fd",
            "iat": 1776222894,
            "exp": 1776226494
          },
          "signature_b64": "cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ"
        },
        {
          "name": "Resource Token",
          "typ": "aa-resource+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InJlc291cmNlLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcmVzb3VyY2Urand0In0..MEYCIQDcontent_addressing_resource_token_display_only",
          "header": {
            "alg": "ES256",
            "kid": "resource-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-resource+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://calendar.example.com",
            "dwk": "aauth-resource.json",
            "aud": "https://ps.example",
            "jti": "rt-ca-890a",
            "ps": "https://ps.example",
            "sub": "e4da3b7fbbce2345d7772b0674a318d5",
            "person_token_jti": "pt-8b41fd",
            "agent_jkt": "NzbLsXh8uDCcd-6MNwXF4W_7noWXFZAfHkxZsRGC9Xs",
            "r3_uri": "https://calendar.example.com/r3/7c8y_bd59q9fc9rm",
            "r3_s256": "7c8Y_BD59Q9FC9rml9BURuiBPGaolZ1OHUB1N-KZZN8",
            "iat": 1741825000,
            "exp": 1741825300
          },
          "signature_b64": "MEYCIQDcontent_addressing_resource_token_display_only"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        "The agent presents a person token for this resource and requests two MCP tools.",
        "The resource maps them to an R3 document whose display carries an irreversible warning — sent invitations cannot be recalled.",
        "The resource token carries r3_uri and r3_s256, plus ps, sub and person_token_jti from the person token.",
        "aud=PS URL: a three-party flow. The PS is the token authority and handles consent.",
        "The agent cannot read the R3 document. It only carries the hash."
      ],
      "signature": {
        "scheme": "jwt",
        "signature_base": "\"@method\": POST\n\"@authority\": calendar.example.com\n\"@path\": /authorize\n\"content-type\": application/json\n\"content-digest\": sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:\n\"signature-key\": sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"\n\"@signature-params\": (\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"",
        "covered_components": [
          "@method",
          "@authority",
          "@path",
          "content-type",
          "content-digest",
          "signature-key"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "ps",
      "label": "POST /token + resource token → 202 deferred (user consent required)",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://ps.example/auth-token",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "ps.example",
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Content-Digest": "sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000120;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:U2lnbmF0dXJlQnl0ZXNFeGFtcGxlVmFsdWVGb3JEZW1vbnN0cmF0aW9uUHVycG9zZXNPbmx5:"
      },
      "request_body": {
        "resource_token": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InJlc291cmNlLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoicmVzb3VyY2Urand0In0…"
      },
      "response_status": 202,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Location": "https://ps.example/pending/d4e5f6a7b8c9",
        "Retry-After": "2",
        "AAuth-Requirement": "requirement=interaction; url=\"https://ps.example/consent?req=d4e5f6a7b8c9\"; code=\"D4E5-F6A7\""
      },
      "response_body": {
        "status": "pending",
        "detail": "User consent required — R3 document contains irreversible actions"
      },
      "tokens": [],
      "annotations": [
        "Agent sends the resource token to its PS. PS sees aud=its own URL — it is the sole token authority (3-party).",
        "PS sees r3_uri and r3_s256 in the resource token. It needs to fetch the R3 document to evaluate policy and show consent.",
        "PS returns 202 Accepted with a pending URL (for polling) and an interaction URL (for the user to visit and consent).",
        "PS fetches the R3 doc in the background (step 3) to populate the consent UI before the user arrives."
      ],
      "signature": {
        "scheme": "jwt",
        "signature_base": "\"@method\": POST\n\"@authority\": ps.example\n\"@path\": /auth-token\n\"content-type\": application/json\n\"content-digest\": sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:\n\"signature-key\": sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"\n\"@signature-params\": (\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000120;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000120;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "covered_components": [
          "@method",
          "@authority",
          "@path",
          "content-type",
          "content-digest",
          "signature-key"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "from": "ps",
      "to": "resource",
      "label": "GET /r3/a1b2c3d4 → R3 document with display fields for consent",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://calendar.example.com/r3/7c8y_bd59q9fc9rm",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "calendar.example.com",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\");created=1741825002;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwks_uri;jwks_uri=\"https://ps.example/.well-known/jwks.json\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:UFNGZXRjaGVzUjNEb2NGb3JDb25zZW50VVJMU2lnQmFzZTY0::"
      },
      "request_body": null,
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Cache-Control": "immutable"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "vocabulary": "urn:aauth:vocabulary:mcp",
        "operations": [
          {
            "tool": "create_calendar_event"
          },
          {
            "tool": "send_calendar_invite"
          }
        ],
        "display": {
          "summary": "Create events and send meeting invitations on your work calendar",
          "implications": "New calendar events will be created. Meeting invitations will be sent to specified attendees from your calendar identity.",
          "data_accessed": "Event titles, times, attendee email addresses, and calendar identity (display name and email)",
          "irreversible": "Sent meeting invitations cannot be unsent. Recipients will receive email notifications immediately upon event creation."
        }
      },
      "tokens": [],
      "r3_document": {
        "vocabulary": "urn:aauth:vocabulary:mcp",
        "operations": [
          {
            "tool": "create_calendar_event"
          },
          {
            "tool": "send_calendar_invite"
          }
        ],
        "display": {
          "summary": "Create events and send meeting invitations on your work calendar",
          "implications": "New calendar events will be created. Meeting invitations will be sent to specified attendees from your calendar identity.",
          "data_accessed": "Event titles, times, attendee email addresses, and calendar identity (display name and email)",
          "irreversible": "Sent meeting invitations cannot be unsent. Recipients will receive email notifications immediately upon event creation."
        }
      },
      "annotations": [
        "The PS fetches the R3 document to populate the consent UI. Agents cannot fetch this endpoint — only the PS, or the AS in four-party.",
        "The PS hashes the bytes it received and compares to r3_s256 from the resource token. Mismatch → reject.",
        "There is no version field: -02 removed it. A reader ignores members it does not recognize, and the digest is what pins the semantics.",
        "display is written by the resource — what IT does — not by the agent.",
        "display.irreversible is the field that makes the PS require explicit approval rather than deciding on policy alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "from": "user",
      "to": "ps",
      "label": "User reviews consent (irreversible warning shown) → approves",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://ps.example/consent?req=d4e5f6a7b8c9",
      "request_headers": {
        "Cookie": "session=user-session-abc123",
        "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0"
      },
      "request_body": null,
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "text/html"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "_ui": "consent_page",
        "agent": "aauth:local@agent.example",
        "resource": "calendar.example.com",
        "r3_summary": "Create events and send meeting invitations on your work calendar",
        "r3_implications": "Meeting invitations will be sent to specified attendees from your calendar identity.",
        "r3_data_accessed": "Event titles, times, attendee email addresses, and calendar identity",
        "r3_irreversible": "⚠️ Sent meeting invitations cannot be unsent",
        "user_action": "approved"
      },
      "tokens": [],
      "annotations": [
        "PS renders the consent page using the display fields from the R3 document.",
        "The irreversible warning is prominently shown: 'Sent meeting invitations cannot be unsent'.",
        "User sees exactly what the resource itself declared — not what the agent claims it will do.",
        "User approves. The PS can now issue the auth token."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "ps",
      "label": "Poll /pending/... → 200 auth token (r3_s256 = immutable audit record)",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://ps.example/pending/d4e5f6a7b8c9",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "ps.example",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1741825060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:UG9sbGluZ1BlbmRpbmdQU1VSTFNpZ25hdHVyZUJhc2U2NEFmdGVyQ29uc2VudA==:"
      },
      "request_body": null,
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "auth_token": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYXV0aCtqd3QifQ.Y29udGVudC1hZGRyZXNzZWQtcHMtYXV0aC10b2tlbi1wYXlsb2Fk.placeholder",
        "expires_in": 900
      },
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "Auth Token (with audit trail)",
          "typ": "aa-auth+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYXV0aCtqd3QifQ..MEYCIQDcontent_addressed_audit_auth_token_display_only",
          "header": {
            "alg": "ES256",
            "kid": "ps-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-auth+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://ps.example",
            "dwk": "aauth-person.json",
            "aud": "https://calendar.example.com",
            "jti": "at-ca-1f2e3d",
            "ps": "https://ps.example",
            "sub": "e4da3b7fbbce2345d7772b0674a318d5",
            "cnf": {
              "jwk": {
                "kty": "OKP",
                "crv": "Ed25519",
                "x": "NzbLsXh8uDCcd-6MNwXF4W_7noWXFZAfHkxZsRGC9Xs"
              }
            },
            "r3_uri": "https://calendar.example.com/r3/7c8y_bd59q9fc9rm",
            "r3_s256": "7c8Y_BD59Q9FC9rml9BURuiBPGaolZ1OHUB1N-KZZN8",
            "r3_granted": {
              "vocabulary": "urn:aauth:vocabulary:mcp",
              "operations": [
                {
                  "tool": "create_calendar_event"
                },
                {
                  "tool": "send_calendar_invite"
                }
              ]
            },
            "iat": 1741825065,
            "exp": 1741825965
          },
          "signature_b64": "MEYCIQDcontent_addressed_audit_auth_token_display_only"
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        "After approval, the next poll returns the PS-issued auth token (iss=PS in three-party).",
        "r3_uri and r3_s256 are baked into the auth token: a permanent record of which document was in effect at approval.",
        "If the resource later serves different bytes at the same URI, existing tokens still name the hash that was approved. New resource tokens name the new one.",
        "The PS's log records r3_uri and r3_s256 alongside (iss, sub) and the timestamp. It records no agent identifier from any token — no token a resource reads carries one — but it knows the agent from the agent token that signed the request to it."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "token_flow": [
    {
      "token": "resource_token",
      "label": "Resource Token",
      "tokenType": "aa-resource+jwt",
      "accent": "resource",
      "events": [
        {
          "step": 1,
          "participant": "resource",
          "label": "Issued with r3_uri + r3_s256 (aud=PS)",
          "kind": "issued"
        },
        {
          "step": 2,
          "participant": "agent",
          "label": "Forwarded to Person Server",
          "kind": "forwarded"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "token": "auth_token",
      "label": "Auth Token",
      "tokenType": "aa-auth+jwt",
      "accent": "auth",
      "events": [
        {
          "step": 5,
          "participant": "ps",
          "label": "Issued by PS after user consent",
          "kind": "issued"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "deferred_timeline": {
    "title": "User Consent Flow",
    "events": [
      {
        "step": 2,
        "status": 202,
        "label": "Deferred — consent required",
        "detail": "PS needs user approval. R3 doc has irreversible action: sent invitations cannot be recalled."
      },
      {
        "step": 5,
        "status": 200,
        "label": "Approved — auth token issued",
        "detail": "User reviewed the R3 display fields and approved. Auth token includes r3_s256 as immutable audit record."
      }
    ]
  }
}
